    "enUS": {
      "description": " Yeah, you're obviously not the smartest {class} to come into Stormwind, but you're about to be one of the dumbest to never leave.\n\nHave you met me friends?",
      "dialogue": {
        "67c36c3e30fec5e622d7": "I didn't mean anything by the comment 'bout you being a stupid $C. We're friends, right? No hard feelings?",
        "79af4e3f1a6c6d10068e": "So, you came to me for a reason. What is it you need?",
        "e8c362578dfe7255374e": " Yeah, you're obviously not the smartest $c to come into Stormwind, but you're about to be one of the dumbest to never leave.$B$BHave you met me friends?"
      },
